{comment: Chorus}
Gonna be gone in the twinkling of an eye
Gonna be gone and I won’t have time to say goodbye
Gonna be gone and it could be while I’m singing this song
Gonna be gone and it won’t be long, Gonna be gone

{comment: Verse 1}
It could be just any morning, it could be at night or noon
We don’t know just when He’s coming, But we know He’s coming soon
I can say with calm assurance This old world is not my home
One day you’re gonna look for me, But praise God I’m gonna be gone

{comment: Verse 2}
